0..74 Comment "// A world\'s requirement is a row, each entry refused as a row refuses it."
75..77 Comment "//"
78..150 Comment "// A role\'s requirement must name what a site can answer. That is a host"
151..225 Comment "// interface the site grants, or an effect theory at fixed sorts under the"
226..261 Comment "// label the role performs through."
262..264 Comment "//"
265..344 Comment "// `world w requires [ … ] ;` is read entry by entry. An entry naming nothing"
345..420 Comment "// is refused by its name. So is a theory under no label, a model theory, a"
421..468 Comment "// sort left unfixed and a label written twice."
469..471 Comment "//"
472..543 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.gandr` — a world requiring"
544..595 Comment "//   `std.io.Console.Eff` and a store under `store`"
597..629 Comment "// The console\'s host interface."
